[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4331.91, "timestamp": "01:12:11", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4335.89, "timestamp": "01:12:15", "text": "哦，对不起。我不是故意给你打电话的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.79, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4345.51, "timestamp": "01:12:25", "text": "为什么这是质量？我爱你。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4348.31, "timestamp": "01:12:28", "text": "我应该怎么做才能成为一名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.229, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4360.27, "timestamp": "01:12:40", "text": "好的。等待。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4362.39, "timestamp": "01:12:42", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4367.11, "timestamp": "01:12:47", "text": "另外，我得走了。我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.51, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "我希望我不会陷入困境。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4372.31, "timestamp": "01:12:52", "text": "因为这样做而改变了路线。我很害怕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4374.47, "timestamp": "01:12:54", "text": "尽管。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.99, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "这次我们好好享受在一起的时光吧。"}]